{
  "info": {
    "name": "Clicks Customer/Technician API - Complete Collection",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for all REST endpoints in clicks-customer-tech-api.\n\n⚠️ **IMPORTANT - WEBSOCKET TESTING:**\n\nPostman CANNOT test WebSocket/Socket.IO connections directly. For WebSocket testing, use:\n\n1. **HTML Test Files** (Recommended):\n   - Located in `test-files/` folder\n   - `customer-sos-test.html` - Test customer SOS flow\n   - `technician-app-test.html` - Test technician workflow\n\n2. **Socket.IO Client Tools:**\n   - Socket.IO Client (web): https://amritb.github.io/socketio-client-tool/\n   - Chrome Extension: Smart Websocket Client\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🔌 **WEBSOCKET NAMESPACES:**\n\n**Customer Namespace:** `ws://localhost:5001/customer`\n- Emit: `register`, `createSOS`, `cancelSOS`\n- Listen: `sosCreated`, `sosInCall`, `technicianAssigned`, `technicianAccepted`, `technicianEnRoute`, `technicianArrived`, `jobStarted`, `jobCompleted`, `jobCancelled`, `locationUpdate`, `sosExpired`, `sosCancelled`\n\n**Technician Namespace:** `ws://localhost:5001/technician`\n- Emit: `register`, `updateLocation`, `startEnRoute`, `markArrived`, `startJob`, `paymentReceived`\n- Listen: `newJobAssigned`, `enRouteConfirmed`, `arrivedConfirmed`, `jobStartedConfirmed`, `paymentConfirmed`, `jobCancelled`, `error`\n\n**Admin Namespace:** `ws://localhost:5001/admin`\n- Emit: `register`, `sosAccepted`, `adminCancelJob`\n- Listen: `newSOSRequest`, `jobCancelled`\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n📊 **JOB STATUS FLOW:**\n\npending → assigned → accepted → en_route → arrived → in_progress → completed → paid\n\n**REST API Actions:**\n- Accept Job: POST /api/technicians/jobs/:id/accept (assigned → accepted)\n- Reject Job: POST /api/technicians/jobs/:id/reject (assigned → cancelled)\n- Complete Job: POST /api/jobs/:id/complete (in_progress → completed)\n\n**WebSocket Actions:**\n- startEnRoute: accepted → en_route\n- markArrived: en_route → arrived\n- startJob: arrived → in_progress\n- paymentReceived: completed → paid (notifies customer)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n📚 **DOCUMENTATION:**\n- Complete Booking Flow: `BOOKING_FLOW_DOCUMENTATION.md`\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nThis collection contains REST API endpoints. For WebSocket events, use the test HTML files or tools mentioned above.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
